	(text "J2: 1 3V3 (fused)  2 IO1  3 IO2  4 IO3  5 IO4  6 IO7  7 IO8 I2C SDA  8 IO9 I2C SCL  9 IO10  10 GND.  All ADC1 (usable with Wi-Fi).\n1k series + SRV05-4 clamp on every line. 10nF filter on analog lines; 4.7k I2C pull-ups DNP.\nIO3 is a strapping pin (JTAG select, only if the eFuse is set)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
