	(text "J3: 1 3V3 (fused)  2 IO11 SPI MOSI  3 IO12 SPI SCK\n4 IO13 SPI MISO  5 IO14 SPI CS  6 IO15  7 IO16  8 IO17 UART1 TX  9 IO18 UART1 RX  10 GND.\n1k series + SRV05-4 clamp on every line (keep SPI to ~4 MHz).\nADC2 pins: no analog while Wi-Fi is on."
